<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include(`${partials}/head`, {
  noGlobalScripts: true,
  pageMeta: {
    title: 'TETRAVAULT Staking on Robinhood Chain | vfat.tools',
    description: 'Live TETRAVAULT (TETRA) staking TVL, realised emission APR, reserve backing per token, bond price and direct wallet actions on Robinhood Chain. Every value comes from onchain contracts.',
    url: 'https://vfat.tools/robinhood/tetravault/',
    image: 'https://vfat.tools/img/robinhood-tetravault-social.png',
    imageAlt: 'Live vfat.tools TETRAVAULT staking table on Robinhood Chain.',
    imageWidth: 1200,
    imageHeight: 630
  }
}); -%>

<body>
<%- include(`${partials}/header_main`); -%>
<pre id="tetra-banner">
***************** 👨‍🌾 UNOFFICIAL TETRAVAULT STAKING CALCULATOR 👨‍🌾 *****************
INFO  : https://tetravault.xyz
CHAIN : Robinhood Chain (4663)
MODE  : Wallet-only onchain reads and direct wallet transactions. No price API or router.
PRICE : TETRA from its own USDG pool (hook spot); the reserve from the protocol's onchain Mark.
NOTE  : Emissions are conditional. The controller mints to stakers at a 6h close only
        when backing per TETRA grew (33% of the growth, max 1% of circulating), so the
        APR shown is a REALISED trailing average, not a promised rate. Some epochs pay nothing.
        Trades carry a 5% tax (4% to the reserve, 1% ops). Stake rewards scale with holding
        time: 50% under 1 day, 75% under 2 days, 100% after.
***************************************************************************************

</pre>
<div id="tetra-loading" class="tetra-loading" role="status" aria-live="polite">
  <span id="tetra-loading-spinner" class="tetra-spinner" aria-hidden="true">[....]</span> <span id="tetra-loading-text">Reading TETRAVAULT contracts on Robinhood Chain…</span>
</div>
<div id="tetra-app" aria-live="polite"></div>
<%- include(`${partials}/disclaimer`); -%>
<style>
  .tetra-action { margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; background: transparent; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; font: inherit; text-decoration: underline; }
  .tetra-action:disabled { cursor: not-allowed; opacity: .45; text-decoration: none; }
  .tetra-loading { padding: 10px 0; }
  .tetra-loading[hidden] { display: none; }
  .tetra-spinner { display: inline-block; width: 6ch; }
  .tetra-form-label { display: block; margin: 7px 0; }
  .tetra-form-label input { margin-left: 8px; font: inherit; }
  #tetra-app, #tetra-app section { min-width: 0; }
  #tetra-banner, #tetra-app pre { box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 100%; }
  #tetra-banner, #tetra-app pre { overflow-wrap: anywhere; white-space: pre-wrap; }
</style>
<%- include(`${partials}/scripts_onchain`, {scriptname: 'robinhood_tetravault'}); -%>
</body>
</html>
